Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: epistle-panel
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, epistle, podup, glyndor-archive-keyring
Description: web panel for the epistle mail server, installed as a stack service
 epistle-panel is the web interface for epistle: webmail and administration
 on top of epistle's management API.
 .
 This package carries no application code and no Node runtime. The panel runs
 only inside its container image, ghcr.io/glyndor/epistle-panel. The package
 installs one small file naming the image tag that matches the package version;
 epistle reads it and adds the panel service to the stack it generates. The
 package creates no account, no directory and no secret.
